ent-ActionRetractableItemArmBlade = Arm Blade
    .desc = Shed your flesh and reform it into a fleshy blade.
ent-ActionChangelingDevour = [color=red]Devour[/color]
    .desc = Consume the essence of your victims and subsume their identity and mind into your own.
ent-ActionChangelingTransform = [color=red]Transform[/color]
    .desc = Transform and assume the identities of those you have devoured.
ent-ActionChangelingBiodegrade = Biodegrade
    .desc = Vomit acid over your restraints to escape. Requires 20 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingStasis = [color=red]Enter Stasis[/color]
    .desc = Fake your death and regenerate all damage while in stasis.
ent-ActionChangelingStasisWeak = [color=red]Enter Stasis[/color]
    .desc = Fake your death and regenerate all damage while in stasis.
ent-ActionChangelingStore = DNA Store
    .desc = Opens the evolution ability store.
ent-ActionChangelingVoiceMimic = Voice Mimicry
    .desc = Reshape your vocal cords to imitate another voice.
ent-ActionChangelingStingDna = Extract DNA
    .desc = Secretly copy a target's identity. Requires 50 chemicals and grants no store DNA or devour progress.
ent-ActionChangelingStingBlind = Blind Sting
    .desc = Temporarily worsen a target's sight. Requires 30 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingStingCryogenic = Cryogenic Sting
    .desc = Drastically slow a target. Requires 30 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingStingLead = Lethal Sting
    .desc = Inject a slow-acting lethal poison. Requires 50 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingStingHallucinogenic = Hallucinogenic Sting
    .desc = Disrupt a target's higher brain functions. Requires 30 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingStingMute = Mute Sting
    .desc = Secretly prevent a target from speaking. Requires 30 chemicals.
ent-ActionChangelingLastResort = [color=red]Last Resort[/color]
    .desc = Destroy your current body and escape as a headslug.
ent-ActionChangelingTakeOverCorpse = Take Over Corpse
    .desc = Infest a corpse to return to your true form.
ent-ActionChangelingNightVision = Toggle Night Vision
    .desc = Turns your night vision on or off.
ent-ActionChangelingScreech = Screech
    .desc = Produce a deafening screech that weakens everyone nearby.
ent-ActionChangelingFakeMindshieldToggle = [color=green]Toggle Fake Mindshield[/color]
    .desc = Turn fake mindshield visibility on or off.
